{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20255","headline":"吊卢殷 九 · 孟郊","name":"吊卢殷 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"同人少相哭，异类多相号。\n始知禽兽痴，却至天然高。\n非子病无泪，非父念莫劳。\n如何裁亲疎，用礼如用刀。\n孤丧鲜匍匐，闭哀抱郁陶。\n烦他手中葬，诚信焉能褒。\n嗟嗟无子翁，死弃如脱毛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20255.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20255","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}